# FilsPay: see CLAUDE.md for the full instructions. The short version:
# - Money is integer fils, 1 BD = 1000 fils, BIGINT columns. No floats, no cents.
# - A settlement day is midnight to midnight Asia/Bahrain (UTC+3).
# - packages/money is correct; tests can encode bugs; comments and changelogs lie.
# - Reproduce before fixing. One bug, one commit, smallest change, a test that fails on the old code.
# - No Co-Authored-By lines. Do not push or deploy unless asked.
